#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Welcome to KMobileTools' Bluetooth finder wizard!<br>\n"
#~ "<font color=red><b>NOTE</b></font>: This wizard is deprecated. You should upgrade your kdebluetooth installation to <a href=\"http://bluetooth.kmobiletools.org\">kdebluetooth 1.0 beta2</a> or higher, then recompile kmobiletools, to get bluetooth directly integrated in KMobileTools New Device Wizard.<br>\n"
#~ "Before starting, make sure that your mobile phone has bluetooth active. You must also set \"Phone Visibility\" to <font color=red><b>ON</b></font><br>\n"
#~ "Your phone will also probably ask for a pin: make sure you have the lastest version of the <a href=\"http://kde-bluetooth.sourceforge.net/\">KDE Bluetooth Framework</a>. It will help with its own pin-helper program. <a href=\"http://docs.kde.org/development/en/extragear-pim/kdebluetooth/faq.html#id2550492\">Here</a> and <a href=\"http://www.handhelds.org/moin/moin.cgi/BluePinHelper\">here</a> you will find some instructions to set up your pin helper correctly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Benvido ao asistente para procuras Bluetooth de  KMobileTools!<br>\n"
#~ "Antes de comezar, asegure-se de que o seu móbel ten o bluetooth activo. Tamén debe <font color=red><b>activar</b></font> a \"Visibilidade do Teléfone\"<br>\n"
#~ "Posibelmente o teléfone pergunte por un pin: asegure-se de ter a última versión do <a href=\"http://kde-bluetooth.sourceforge.net/\">Framework para Bluetooth de KDE</a>. Axudará co seu programa auxiliar para pin. <a href=\"http://docs.kde.org/development/en/extragear-pim/kdebluetooth/faq.html#id2550492\">Aqui</a> e <a href=\"http://www.handhelds.org/moin/moin.cgi/BluePinHelper\">aqui</a> ha achar algunhas instrucións para configurar correctamente o axudante para pins."

#~ msgid "Find services"
#~ msgstr "Procurar servizos"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Now choose the service to use for serial communications.\n"
#~ "If unsure, simply leave the default value.\n"
#~ "The best choice (preselected if found) is to use <b>Dial-Up Networking</b><br>Another good option often found is <b>Serial Port</b>, but it's well known that in some phones it seems to do actually nothing. On some phones, there are other service names, like <b>COM 1</b>. Just select the first thing that seems to be related to a serial port."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Agora escolla o servizo para usar nas comunicazóns por série.\n"
#~ "Se non está seguro, deixe o valor por omisión.\n"
#~ "A mellor escolla (pre-escollida se é atopada) é usar <b>Rede telefónica</b> <br>Outra boa opzón atopada a miúdo é <b>Porto Série</b>, pero é sabido que nalguns teléfones parece non facer nada. Noutros modelos hai outros nomes de servizo, como  <b>COM1</b>. Simplesmente escolla o primeiro que pareza estar relacionado cun porto série."

